Branch & Order combines two MIT-licensed Obsidian plugins into one,
embedding their official build outputs unmodified:

  - Branch Note — https://github.com/elfmedy/branch-note
  - Explorer Order Editor — https://github.com/vcarus/obsidian-explorer-order-editor

The host/orchestration layer of Branch & Order is additionally licensed
below under the MIT license.

